# Accepted vulnerabilities for the image scan (Trivy, in CI's image job): one ID per line, each with a
# comment giving the reason it does not apply or cannot be fixed yet, and a date to review it by. Keep this
# short: fix what can be fixed (bump the dependency or the base image digest) instead.
#
# Example:
#   # Not reachable: <why>. Review by 2026-12-31.
#   CVE-0000-00000
